/E (The project is located in Kodagu district, a predominantly rural and semi-urban region of Karnataka known for its dispersed population and plantation-based economy. The primary beneficiaries are approximately 1,200 school students, representing children and adolescents from nearby villages and small towns. The demographic profile largely includes youth from middle- and lower-income households, with limited access to modern sports infrastructure. The student population is likely diverse in terms of socio-economic backgrounds, with a mix of communities typical of rural Kodagu.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [22]
>>
