/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 199 0 R
/E (Gonikoppal High School is a well-established educational institution in Kodagu district with a student strength of over 1,200 and a legacy marked by its Golden Jubilee celebration in 2015. The region experiences high rainfall, which significantly restricts outdoor sports activities for a large part of the year. In this context, the project was conceptualized to address the lack of indoor sports infrastructure and to promote holistic development through improved access to physical education and recreational facilities.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
