/P 199 0 R
/E (The project is based on the assumption that providing access to quality sports infrastructure will enhance student participation in physical activities, which in turn will improve physical health, discipline, and overall engagement in school. The assessment by Crux and the findings indicate that the indoor stadium has led to increased participation in sports and extracurricular activities. The team, during discussion, collected information from all stakeholders that the project contributed to improved attendance, reduced absenteeism, and enhanced student motivation and engagement.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
