/E (The proposed construction of an indoor stadium at Gonikoppal High School Ground in Kodagu District is well aligned with the local developmental priorities of promoting youth engagement, sports infrastructure, and community well-being. Kodagu, known for its strong sporting culture, especially in badminton, has a growing need for all-weather sports facilities to support students and local talent throughout the year. This project addresses the gap in accessible indoor infrastructure, enabling uninterrupted training and hosting of events regardless of climatic conditions, which is particularly important in a region with heavy monsoon seasons.)
