614 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 203 0 R
/E (Hoovinahadagalli in Bellary district is a semi-rural area with a significant proportion of economically and socially disadvantaged populations, with approximately 65% belonging to SC/ST communities. The absence of a dedicated common space for community activities was a key developmental gap. The project was initiated based on a request from the Kittur Rani Chennamma Panchamasali Trust to address this need. The community hall has been established as a shared public asset aimed at supporting social, educational, and developmental activities, aligning with rural development priorities under Schedule VII of the Companies Act, 2013, and the Bahujan Samrakshan thematic focus.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
