687 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 208 0 R
/E (Karkala, located in Udupi district, is a growing town with increasing need for public recreational infrastructure. Prior to the intervention, there was limited access to organized green spaces for community use. The project was conceptualized to create an accessible and inclusive public space catering to people of all age groups for walking, relaxation, and physical fitness activities. The initiative aligns with environmental sustainability objectives under Schedule VII of the Companies Act, 2013, and falls under the Prakruthi Samrakshan thematic area.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [11]
>>
